  "bbox": [
   1752,
   817,
   2287,
   898
  ],
  "angle": 0,
  "joined": false
 },
 {
  "text": "kept — the default curve is fine for me",
  "role": "body",
  "bbox": [
   1749,
   927,
   2301,
   980
  ],
  "angle": 0,
  "joined": false
 },
 {
  "text": "removed — I use my own formula",
  "role": "body",
  "bbox": [
   1737,
   1027,
   2241,
   1083
  ],
  "angle": 0,
  "joined": false
 },
 {
  "text": "added — I refuse to read any claim filed between midnight and dawn",
  "role": "body",
  "bbox": [
   1742,
   1230,
   2236,
   1318
  ],
  "angle": 0,
  "joined": false
 },
 {
  "text": "policy does not rewrite the standard — it judges the people and the matter. Keep, modify, remove, add — four simple moves on top of a shared starting point.",
  "role": "caption",
  "bbox": [
   272,
   1311,
   1211,
   1354
  ],
  "angle": 0,
  "joined": false
 },
 {
  "text": "VERIFICATION — my policy filters both incoming claims and my own drafts before I issue them. Issuance is verification on the way out.",
  "role": "body",
  "bbox": [
   506,
   1463,
   1221,
   1593
  ],
  "angle": 0,
  "joined": false
 },
 {
  "text": "CONSENSUS — my policy is my vote when the community negotiates shared rules.",
  "role": "body",
  "bbox": [
   1381,
   1475,
   2022,
   1585
  ],
  "angle": 0,
  "joined": false
 },
 {
  "text": "YOUR POLICY JUDGES THE MESSENGER — NOT THE FORM.",
